<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Some soymeal offers higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Some soymeal offers higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some rail soymeal basis offers moved higher on Monday in reaction to market talk that about 30,000 tonnes of soymeal were shipped from Iowa to export points at the Gulf of Mexico, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>Also scheduled downtime at crushing plants for maintenance sparked some higher offers, they said.</p>
<p>Dealers at other locations reduced offers because of sharply higher CBOT soymeal futures notched on Monday and because of light buyer interest on Monday.</p>
